<title>USA: GE says not aware of any deal with BA.</title>
<headline>GE says not aware of any deal with BA.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>A General Electric Co spokesman said Monday he was not aware of any plan for GE to invest in British Airways Plc's engineering arm.</p>
<p>The spokesman refused further comment.</p>
<p>The spokesman was responding to a (London) Sunday Times report that GE was thought to have made tentative approaches to buy a substantial stake in BA's engineering arm.</p>
<p>&quot;Over the past six years we've had a growing relationship with BA... but we're not aware of such a development internally,&quot; the GE spokesman said.</p>
</text>
